ars are assumed to be 2026, based on surrounding entries. Records involving the \"Quiet Return\" offer (QR7) are from July 12–21, 2026. Data for the \"Harbor\" offer (H1) spans August 10–24, 2026. The exposure windows for both offers, including refund consideration, are clearly within the period of interest.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"view_file","args":{"AbsolutePath":"\"/workspace/work/antigravity.log\"","EndLine":"50","StartLine":"1","toolAction":"\"Viewing file\"","toolSummary":"\"Check antigravity.log\""}}],"truncated_fields":["thinking"]}
